OL,5,G2200 The Castle of Mey: The Queen
OL,6,G     Mother's Hideaway
OL,7,     FWe uncover the mysteries of the
OL,8,     FHighland retreat adored by King
OL,9,     FCharles and the Queen Mother.
OL,10,     FBought in 1952, it became a royal
OL,11,     Fhaven, hosting vibrant gatherings.
OL,12,G2300 Taggart
OL,13,     FKaren Lennox is found electrocuted
OL,14,     Fin what appears to be a lightning
OL,15,     Fstrike, but then another body
OL,16,     Fturns up and the team begin
OL,17,     Flooking for a murderer.
